    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Input: {{ $json.video_prompt }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# 🎬 AI Video Prompt – UGC Outdoor Scene\n\nA **realistic, natural-looking video** in **UGC (User Generated Content)** style featuring a **young woman with curly hair**, around 25 years old, with Mediterranean features and glowing skin. \n\nShe’s casually dressed in a light beige top and denim jacket, holding the **exact product shown in the provided reference image** — the product must appear **unchanged in every detail**.\n\nThe scene takes place **outdoors**, on a **sunny afternoon** in a **quiet urban park** with trees, gentle wind, and soft natural lighting. The camera is in **selfie mode**, held in the woman’s hand, creating **subtle handheld movements** as she walks along a path lined with greenery. The sunlight filters through the leaves, creating **natural highlights and soft shadows** on her face. Occasional background blur (bokeh) enhances realism.\n\nThe woman speaks in **English**, with an **enthusiastic, authentic, and spontaneous** tone, smiling as she talks directly to the camera.  \n\nHer dialogue (in English):  \n> “I absolutely love this curl cream! It keeps my hair bouncy, curly, and light all day long. You absolutely have to try it!”\n\nThe video is captured in **one continuous shot (no cuts or angle changes)**, maintaining a smooth flow and **realistic motion blur** from her walking. Ambient sounds such as faint birds and distant chatter can be softly present in the background to heighten realism.\n\nThe overall tone is **warm, lively, and natural**, as if recorded by a real person on a smartphone, with **true-to-life lighting, skin tones, and camera dynamics**.\n"
        }
      },
